    "description": "Buổi 7 theo syllabus FLM · 9 slide.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SAL301 · Chapter 3 · Session 7</span>\n<h2>Session 7 — Chapter 2. Sales strategies</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14196 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SAL301 · Chương 3 · Buổi 7</span>\n<h2>Buổi 7 — Chapter 2. Sales strategies</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14196 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">9</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">9</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 2. Sales strategies<br>- Sales and Marketing planning</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Textbook reading<br>Questions listing</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CT1</strong> — Explain the differences between marketing strategies and sales strategies</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM (9 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the chapter number in the deck name. File: SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM (9 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số chương ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/001.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 1: Session 4:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 1/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Session 4:<br>Chapter 2. Sales strategies</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/002.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 2: Learning Objectives\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 2/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Learning Objectives<br>Understand and appreciate the differences between sales and marketing strategies<br>Appreciate where the key marketing concepts fit into the planning process<br>Identify component parts of the communications mix<br>Differentiate between objectives, strategies and tactics<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/003.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 3: The planning process\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 3/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>The planning process<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM<br>Figure 2.1  The planning process</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/004.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 4: Establishing marketing plans\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 4/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Establishing marketing plans<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM<br>Figure 2.2  The link among objectives, strategies and tactics<br>Objectives: Where do we intend to go?Types – each requires its own strategy<br>Strategies: How do we intend to get there?Several may be evaluated but only one employed<br>Tactics: What is the precise route to be taken?There may be several tactics for one strategy</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/005.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 5: The place of selling in the marketing plan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 5/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>The place of selling in the marketing plan<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM<br>Figure 2.6  An overview of the marketing planning process</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/006.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 6: Influence of marketing plan on sales activities: strategies and tactics\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 6/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Influence of marketing plan on sales activities: strategies and tactics<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM<br>Figure 2.7 Inside-out planning model:<br>Figure 2.8 Outside-in planning model:</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/007.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 7: The promotional mix\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 7/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>The promotional mix<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM<br>Advertising<br>Sales promotion<br>Publicity/public relations<br>Personal selling<br>Direct marketing<br>Interactive marketing (internet marketing)</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/008.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 8: Stages in the buying process\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 8/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Stages in the buying process<br>SangVM.S4.C2.MKT301.SANGVM<br>A push strategy is one in which the focus of marketing effort is aimed at pushing the product through the channel of distribution.<br>A pull strategy relies much more heavily on creating awareness, interest and promoting the product to the final consumer.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SAL301/flm1/d02/009.webp\" alt=\"SAL301 · SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 9: Thanks for following up!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">SangVM.S4.C2.SAL301.SANGVM · slide 9/9</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Thanks for following up!<br>All best for You!<br>[email]<br>www.facebook.com/vmsang<br>[sđt]</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
